        "pattern": "the last person / thing ... (to do sth)",
        "meaning_cn": "最不可能／最不愿意做某事的人或事物",
        "definition_en": "the person or thing least likely or least wanted in the stated situation",
        "usage_note": "the last person I would ask = 我最不愿去求助的人；the last thing I expected = 我最没想到的事。依据语境表达极不可能或不愿，不表示时间顺序。",
